{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/47cef75f00f82f96e65dcfb4a5a0afcb.avif?t=1759417809\" data-has-big width=1560 height=262 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Forget. Everything. And. Run. FEAR the Huntsman</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience  one of humanity's most primal fears in Huntsman, a survival horror that will immerse you in the creeping dread and crawling terror\u00a0of arachnophobia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/acfdbcf376dd50fd2a1b03ab706034a2.poster.avif?t=1759417809\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/acfdbcf376dd50fd2a1b03ab706034a2.webm?t=1759417809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/acfdbcf376dd50fd2a1b03ab706034a2.mp4?t=1759417809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new security guard at Atherton Laboratories, chaos erupts as\u00a0eight-legged predators infest the hallways. Outnumbered and defenseless, you must find a way to eliminate the threats and lift the facility lockdown to escape. Will you survive, or become the spider's next prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/8f7322fe9e751332959ddc9eb0355b61.poster.avif?t=1759417809\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/8f7322fe9e751332959ddc9eb0355b61.webm?t=1759417809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/8f7322fe9e751332959ddc9eb0355b61.mp4?t=1759417809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into the Web -\u00a0</strong>Explore a facility overrun by invasive predators. Divert limited power between sections of the building to access new areas, gather vital resources, and outmaneuver the swarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/fcf4bc2444f013a3b00dcc259dfc7b4c.poster.avif?t=1759417809\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/fcf4bc2444f013a3b00dcc259dfc7b4c.webm?t=1759417809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/fcf4bc2444f013a3b00dcc259dfc7b4c.mp4?t=1759417809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improvise or Die</strong> -\u00a0Use your flashlight, throwables, and the environment itself to distract, mislead, and evade the deadliest creatures you've ever faced. Just remember: one wrong move, and you're prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/250a4e12a6c93943cb81a3d120a8940a.poster.avif?t=1759417809\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/250a4e12a6c93943cb81a3d120a8940a.webm?t=1759417809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/250a4e12a6c93943cb81a3d120a8940a.mp4?t=1759417809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fear Has Eight Legs -\u00a0</strong>Experience arachnophobia like never before! Each spider moves, hunts, and reacts with terrifying realism triggering primal instincts your mind won\u2019t be able to ignore.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814680?t=1759417809","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/54aa54ecfefe9a694528852c88e7ab1e5da242ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759417809","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/a69783847121af70465fc540d1d1bbefcb45038b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759417809","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/a69783847121af70465fc540d1d1bbefcb45038b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759417809","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/47cef75f00f82f96e65dcfb4a5a0afcb.avif?t=1759417809\" data-has-big width=1560 height=262 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Forget. Everything. And. Run. FEAR the Huntsman</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></