ng>Explore a facility overrun by invasive predators. Divert limited power between sections of the building to access new areas, gather vital resources, and outmaneuver the swarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/fcf4bc2444f013a3b00dcc259dfc7b4c.poster.avif?t=1759417809\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/fcf4bc2444f013a3b00dcc259dfc7b4c.webm?t=1759417809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/fcf4bc2444f013a3b00dcc259dfc7b4c.mp4?t=1759417809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improvise or Die</strong> -\u00a0Use your flashlight, throwables, and the environment itself to distract, mislead, and evade the deadliest creatures you've ever faced. Just remember: one wrong move, and you're prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/250a4e12a6c93943cb81a3d120a8940a.poster.avif?t=1759417809\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/250a4e12a6c93943cb81a3d120a8940a.webm?t=1759417809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/250a4e12a6c93943cb81a3d120a8940a.mp4?t=1759417809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fear Has Eight Legs -\u00a0</strong>Experience arachnophobia like never before! Each spider moves, hunts, and reacts with terrifying realism triggering primal instincts your mind won\u2019t be able to ignore.</p>","developers":["OnTheHouse Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/38b3f52f6d1ed81fcbd991d5ff7958b7bcd777ec/header.jpg?t=1759417809","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814680/1849060836/aab1b6c8c6db7c0bc768f06a501515cec7e9a14a/1759080631/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759081004","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814680/1849060836/aab1b6c8c6db7c0bc768f06a501515cec7e9a14a/1759080631/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759081004","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814680/1849060836/aab1b6c8c6db7c0bc768f06a501515cec7e9a14a/1759080631/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759081004","id":257208037,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208037/movie480.mp4?t=1759081004","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208037/movie_max.mp4?t=1759081004"},"name":"Huntsman World First Gameplay Trailer and Release Date Announcement","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257208037/341722973ea984024f9cb33517b783c8baf16bea/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759081004","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208037/movie480.webm?t=1759081004","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208037/movie_max.webm?t=1759081004"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814680/598071296/d2a73187a3ee50fe21b04f45d7954efed3f08dea/1756126515/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756144349","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814680/598071296/d2a73187a3ee50fe21b04f45d7954efed3f08dea/1756126515/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756144349","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai